// --- Production notes ---------------------------------------------------------

tutorial_production {
    Recording order: get-started 01→06, then advanced 01→08; pickups allowed out of order.
    Slide decks for [slide_decks] live under ["../../presentations/"] as Reveal.js JSON plus a shared player shell.
    Site embeds those decks under /tutorials per the marketing site tutorials section.
    Each episode may also ship: master video, short vertical teaser (optional), example files under a public examples/tutorials/ tree (path TBD with docs), and a transcript derived from `@script`.
    Thumbnails: dark rust / aqua; episode index; avoid clutter per [show_dont_tell].
    Accessibility: burned-in or downloadable captions from the script; avoid conveying unique info by colour alone on graph filters.
    Keep demos on extension behaviours marked `@status done` in the requirement graph; if a referenced feature is incomplete, note it on-screen as preview or skip that beat.
    @status draft
}

tutorial_success_metrics {
    Qualitative: a viewer can complete the get-started try-this prompts without reading the monorepo.
    Quantitative (once published): marketplace / site CTR from end cards; completion rate on get-started 01–03; example-repo clones or gist hits.
    Feedback loop: file issues against this `.rq` file when scripts drift from product behaviour.
}
